<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Sheaf: third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font: 14px/1.5 -apple-system, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f5f5f7; padding: 1em; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; }
h2 { border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 1em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Sheaf: third-party licences</h1>
<p>Sheaf is distributed as a whole under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later
(see <code>LICENSE</code>). Slint is used under its GPL-3.0 option. The Rust crates compiled into
<code>Sheaf</code> and <code>sheaf</code> are listed below with their licence texts. PDFium and its
bundled libraries are covered by the files in <code>licenses/pdfium/</code>; the Lucide icons by
<code>licenses/lucide-ISC.txt</code>.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
